{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "26ca380f9d34246e6d2dc51d74ba3da34dbb6d11e0bc945a056adccf862f3087", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nえへへ、お待ちしていたんですよ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嘿嘿，我一直在等您呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "831b0e1504627e274393038bdaa30538f34f737b234cdec106e71084fcfd9b8a", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\n何かありましたか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "a4f449e8f617bac09f20c73191e7913887f1d7946ed495f24bb21fb8084516af", "ja": "社長さんが、{$P$}さんに\nお話があるそうです！", "zh": "社长说，有事情要跟{$P$}先生谈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "31e695d63bd5087651578cd6abe3a351d7d9293c19a5de9552691b24ba60875f", "ja": "ほらきっと、アレの話ですよ、アレ！\nみんなが楽しみにしている、あの一大イベント……！", "zh": "您看，肯定是那件事啦，就是那件事！\n大家都期待已久的那场盛大活动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9e8d38f96b4ffdc148c9b9b3df529af53f2cccd4ad433905bf400f7b0fa2211d", "ja": "あ、ああ、アレ！　なんとなくわかりました。\nでは、行ってきます！", "zh": "啊、啊，是那个！我大概明白了。\n那么，我这就去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "a88ee4fd817025c0ca99c8e12d9ab01cfd619a74ecdbfa86d0eb9348bfbd9641", "ja": "はい！　行ってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好的！路上小心——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1006_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1007_president", "source_sha256": "d8f8907de39b30839e55e9887c40b1d7481eb7f73d4af4f443bdfae6d32d1cbf", "ja": "千葉といえば、なんといっても海鮮だよ！\n我々もひとつ、入念に下調べをして行こうじゃないか！", "zh": "说到千叶，最不能错过的当然就是海鲜啦！\n我们也来好好做一番调查，再出发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "0b5255ddd12169313429ec4b680131e0c8168c60ceebd3ebfbe9253b3d5fa3a8", "ja": "海鮮！　うわぁ、いいなぁ……。\n私、美味しい貝が食べたいです！", "zh": "海鲜！哇——真好啊……  \n我想吃美味的贝类！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4e272234f10d3a45ef72eb46b5cc64c1736526952f3330d6553e3f1db732e6ee", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "社长、音无小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "6a3f155adad3b6b05f03a14b506c40b856de0ab87f9189f9514457f65e61e0f4", "ja": "おお君！　お疲れ様。\nところで君、海鮮は好きかね？", "zh": "哦，是你啊！辛苦了。\n话说回来，你喜欢海鲜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4a45f131159b0c615d2701cad74ad5b253f8b50756c583b77f0c6f4e54596cfe", "ja": "はい？　え、ええと……？", "zh": "是？　呃，这个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "52992ef0822bdc400a9a4d306b9b49412353567624ce7e310faf345f03afcccb", "ja": "社長！　質問が唐突すぎます！\n{$P$}さんがびっくりしていますよ。", "zh": "社长！您的问题也太突然了！\n{$P$}先生都被吓到了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "f9bca8d1d614d4b43f04bc16262d1ec81283099bb702ef4ce818babc9ff4113a", "ja": "おっと、すまない。話の間が抜けてしまった。\n今、千葉の海鮮が美味しいという話をしていたんだよ。", "zh": "哎呀，抱歉。不小心漏掉了一段话。\n刚才正在聊千叶的海鲜很好吃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d1cad6410be2ebf092bbc4ee75bc2f2358d97f7f5642728801803677b9180eec", "ja": "千葉、ですか。……ハッ！！　もしや……！", "zh": "千叶吗？……啊！！难道说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "6d2d3bc50b21837bec1af411ea051201d1d0440c850e85306d7f8298f27d14ad", "ja": "ふふふ、君のその察しの良いところが好きだよ。\nそう、『ミリオンシアターシーズン・ファイナル』だ！", "zh": "呵呵，我喜欢你这份敏锐。\n没错，就是《MILLION THE@TER SEASON FINAL》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "ca03e6b6b430fab2654e68ff6202126934817f0c8906081019ea62e1a041d8f4", "ja": "ファイナルシーズン最初の公演は大盛況だった。\nこの熱の冷めないうちに、次の公演を行おう！", "zh": "最终季的首场公演大获成功。\n趁着这股热潮还未冷却，举办下一场公演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "836d71a2226f2c16a1e632b1a3937970fdd5e925ac35349ee18de8dd1f093b23", "ja": "なるほど！　関東各地を巡るツアーの続きを……！", "zh": "原来如此！要继续进行巡游关东各地的演出……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "d9075a35043c017bf6c891b8d042cc783bb8f6cb98ef84a290ba5c4c3474b908", "ja": "その通り！　次はクラブとハートの混合チーム……。\n昼公演の開催だ！", "zh": "没错！接下来是梅花和红桃的混合队伍……  \n午场公演开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "ab3b4b1c85d20ab3456c15a061e1deaaa23a0e10d4bc202e3f0f4a0479d29afe", "ja": "輝かしく光満ちる昼の祝祭、\n『ShineLight』公演……でしたよね！", "zh": "光辉灿烂、充满光芒的白昼庆典，《ShineLight》公演……没错吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "8ce759f1a2c7105692982d5dab4dab7f08e4676c38da91843ce428cba41c4400", "ja": "うむ！　太陽が最も高く、熱くなる時間……。\n最高潮まで熱を高めて、次のチームに繋いでほしい！", "zh": "嗯！太阳升至最高、变得最炽热的时刻……\n请将热情提升至最高潮，再传递给下一支队伍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "1d426b03d80789a14c5f13cd79f7dbe57451bc754bb3aa59ea25bb7f57619676", "ja": "アツアツな公演を、期待しているよ～！", "zh": "我期待着热力十足的演出哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a42557090838b3ce5d6ead990c6bd8d8ed4533f7cae4d40e12a113cfb6c03165", "ja": "はい！　では早速、企画を固めてきます！\nあ、ところで社長……。", "zh": "好的！那我这就去敲定企划！\n啊，对了，社长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "64e82d0d71737839ee528b6570c2894f47fb42f3a0f57a70a08459dd4b2ca374", "ja": "ん？　なにかね？", "zh": "嗯？什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ea778991e222a60b6b496f02ce5f90a8060b59e26eeaeaad37f9ace76b07758c", "ja": "下調べは、お任せしてしまっても？\n美味しいご当地グルメが食べたいです！", "zh": "前期调查就交给您了，可以吗？\n我想吃当地的美食！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "ee5732f69e0f98d8f3adc6d922d0c9f0da1d3444b287ad2e57e16c598ff754a5", "ja": "はっはっは！　わかったよ！　ご当地の\n美味しいものは、私と音無君に任せておきたまえ！", "zh": "哈哈哈！明白了！当地的美味佳肴就交给我和小鸟吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0263_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "2c10fa21423d77f986bbcb3292cbf01ac72ad677ed87dea68fb318a130f670c0", "ja": "（現地での楽しみも、モチベーションのひとつだ。\nよーし……武道館に向けて、盛り上がっていくぞ！）", "zh": "（当地的乐趣也是动力之一。好——为了武道馆演出，打起精神来吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
